CodeSystem: OrdersSnomedSupplementCS
Id: orders-snomed-supplement-cs
Title: "Orders SNOMED CT translations"
Description: "Uzbek and Russian translations for the Orders specialties and hospital referral code not translated by UZ Core 0.12.0."
* insert SupplementCodeSystemDraft(orders-snomed-supplement-cs, $sct, 2026.1.0)

* #394612005 "Urology"
